# Landscapes

Source document for the Landscapes mental model.

## Content Summary
Landscapes is described as a conceptual tool or principle that helps understand and navigate complex situations. It provides a mental shortcut or framework for making sense of patterns and relationships in the world. The model is referenced in Scott Galloway's The Four.

